From: Senior Matthew <SeniorMatt@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 23 Nov 2026 16:02:53 +0500
Subject: [PATCH 4/4] kcm_webshortcuts: not marked as changed right after load
 (filling the widgets emitted markAsChanged)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01X5N5x9eWzmrq6QYrYLwQnk
---
 kcms/webshortcuts/ikwsopts.cpp | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/kcms/webshortcuts/ikwsopts.cpp b/kcms/webshortcuts/ikwsopts.cpp
index f5c16b0..5244ad4 100644
--- a/kcms/webshortcuts/ikwsopts.cpp
+++ b/kcms/webshortcuts/ikwsopts.cpp
@@ -353,6 +353,8 @@ void FilterOptions::load()
 
     const QString delimiter = group.readEntry("KeywordDelimiter", ":");
     setDelimiter(delimiter.at(0).toLatin1());
+    // filling the widgets above emitted markAsChanged(): the page was "changed" right after opening
+    setNeedsSave(false);
 }
 
 char FilterOptions::delimiter()
